	"smallSizeObservation": {
		"en": "At 128/64 px, the counter body, plunger and digit window remain clear. At 32/24/16 px, the compact silhouette and dominant colors carry recognition; fine material detail, printed marks and background lines naturally merge.",
		"zh": "128/64 px 能辨认计数器机身、按钮与数字窗；32/24/16 px 以紧凑轮廓和主色维持识别，精细材质、印记与背景线条自然合并。"
